WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
With the props cards included, open Export image.

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.400
Choose 100%, then scroll to the cards.

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:08.000
As inspected shows the nested values.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:11.940
Show types changes progress from 72 to number.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:15.590
Collapsed reduces project to one Object row.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:19.130
Turn types off. Progress returns to 72 while project stays collapsed.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.920
Download PNG saves the image in the preview.
